Cơ sởcấu tạo hệmật KCK
• Hàm một chiều (one-way function): Y = f(X)
1. Đối với mọi X tính ra Y = f(X) là dễdàng.
2. Khi biết Y rất khó đểtính ra X.
• Ví dụ1: 𝑛= 𝑝 × 𝑞nếu 𝑝và 𝑞đủlớn
• Ví dụ2: 𝑦= 𝑔௫ 𝑚𝑜𝑑 𝑝nếu 𝑔và 𝑝đủlớn
• Hàm cửa sập (trap-door function): Y = f(X, secret)
1. Với mọi Y, dễdàng tính toán X nếu biết secret
2. Ngược lại, nếu không biết secret rất khó đểtính X', '[-0.07722983,0.05926589,-0.040646046,-0.018735588,-0.03543165,-0.037314292,0.047050767,0.019122958,0.06760525,0.038784932,0.11757234,-0.10629121,-0.023519637,-0.020194495,0.0583932,-0.007480669,-0.08907491,0.023589192,-0.035276864,-0.019064354,0.039939374,-0.05684614,0.008286034,-0.034386124,-0.043472853,-0.012051862,-0.01438041,0.054352306,-0.030201184,-0.084969096,-0.012137952,0.13586946,-0.032415494,-0.022634553,-0.004400135,0.020366957,-0.017846486,0.0024398135,0.015354941,0.042204306,-0.036441956,0.036731094,0.061005626,-0.08907183,0.0066963807,0.032815833,-0.046601444,0.06482512,-0.0071135187,-0.07383977,-0.029781412,0.13266605,-0.029483212,0.089631915,0.0018726096,-0.06750155,-0.009219627,-0.0064228214,-0.049082562,0.012378872,-0.010089987,0.054810368,-0.029926615,-0.023379274,0.04047378,-0.091180176,-0.04751133,-0.061661907,-0.0164478,0.05890518,0.0023640504,-0.08923141,-0.03506971,-0.05204464,-0.014499645,0.018844483,-0.05241581,0.016014732,-0.0056228633,-0.1033554,-0.008033297,0.049353592,0.04212776,-0.0026620184,-0.04001412,0.0984608,-0.065663956,0.021458684,0.0061081243,-0.0011047574,0.036587063,0.033227008,-0.09142012,-0.0567418,-0.00045521717,-0.03932097,0.060759366,0.09741796,0.00019204723,0.020755878,-0.014623283,-0.0117583,0.010777604,-0.06583817,-0.039115883,0.026191698,0.06824086,-0.015065199,0.092577055,0.015389221,-0.104796164,-0.057859834,0.01949744,-0.001185747,0.007919466,0.075769246,0.020154713,0.007148009,0.0047889035,0.017897684,0.05395621,-0.053264707,-0.021709288,0.04074874,-0.12172639,-0.05463837,0.07193603,1.5746029e-32,-0.02460314,0.021621965,-0.011913073,-0.10913086,-0.016672416,-0.041549325,-0.061611645,-0.021135055,-0.050476294,0.09464166,-0.10949782,0.012532442,-0.09030839,-0.03216324,-0.031373672,-0.046499282,0.0786738,-0.07828516,0.06905599,-0.050613638,0.09010048,0.015287767,0.021115571,-0.036010332,0.028537644,-0.031795394,-0.022543008,-0.06809205,-0.036795877,0.052487954